# Normalize line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# Rationale: without this file Git applies its platform default
# (core.autocrlf=true on Windows), rewriting LF to CRLF on checkout. That turns
# every diff in this repository into a whole-file rewrite and makes the
# interface files — whose whitespace is not meaningful but whose *contents* are
# ABI-critical — noisy to review.
* text=auto eol=lf
